title: "The Zen Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as Zen practice — four
  disciplines (Sōji, Shoshin, the Clear Mirror / Shōjiki, Gaman) under the ensō and
  the shokunin's total presence, each rule carrying an observable falsifier. Part of
  a small family of conduct harnesses.
